WEBVTT

00:05:58.663 --> 00:06:03.704
And the question is, where do you
direct the the weight of policy

00:06:03.871 --> 00:06:06.038
and what you pay more attention to?

00:06:06.454 --> 00:06:10.829
Very interesting. I like it, so
you're basically saying, look,

00:06:10.829 --> 00:06:12.121
if we have scarce resources,

00:06:12.121 --> 00:06:14.704
whether those are financial
or time or energy,

00:06:14.913 --> 00:06:17.454
we want to concentrate on the group
of people who are suffering

00:06:17.454 --> 00:06:19.579
as opposed to those who
might be languishing.

00:06:20.413 --> 00:06:27.871
You know, it seems to me that to some
extent we have been trapped by words.

00:06:28.163 --> 00:06:33.913
I mean, it's the word happiness which
seems to stand for the whole dimension.